04:24.841 --> 04:28.931
<b>I mean, can't you just give them your specs?{data on specs too meta}</b>

04:29.851 --> 04:31.141
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

04:31.141 --> 04:32.931
<b>So, how was it?</b>

04:32.931 --> 04:36.851
<b>Both the written and fitness tests 
were far too simple.</b>

04:37.311 --> 04:38.611
<b>Right?</b>

04:38.611 --> 04:41.361
<b>Is that really all there is to becoming a hero?</b>

04:41.981 --> 04:44.241
<b>We should get our results soon.</b>

04:44.241 --> 04:46.611
<b>70 points is a passing grade.</b>

04:46.611 --> 04:51.081
<b>The written test was so easy 
anyone could get full points on it.</b>

04:51.081 --> 04:53.371
<b>That just leaves the fitness test,</b>

04:53.371 --> 04:55.541
<b>which should have been a walk in the park for us.</b>

