07:24.651 --> 07:28.531
<b><i>I just wanted to make sure you were notified of this.</i></b>

07:28.531 --> 07:31.201
<b>Yes, I approve.</b>

07:37.121 --> 07:38.411
<b>Genos, huh?</b>

07:39.251 --> 07:41.251
LECTURE HALL #3

07:42.041 --> 07:44.001
<b>First, congratulations on passing.</b>

07:47.841 --> 07:50.881
<b>Now, one of you only made it on a fluke,</b>

07:50.881 --> 07:52.761
<b>so unless you want your luck to go to waste,</b>

07:53.181 --> 07:55.471
<b>I better see you giving it your all.</b>

07:56.801 --> 07:58.761
<b>And don't get full of yourself{all puffed up}!{nice meme viz}</b>

07:58.761 --> 08:03.271
<b>From here on, keep your hero status 
in mind and act modestly!</b>

08:04.021 --> 08:09.191
<b>After all, your faces will be placed on the Hero Association's website.</b>

08:11.491 --> 08:13.401
<b>Did you hear me?</b>

08:13.401 --> 08:16.991
<b>That goofball head of yours is 
gonna be shown to the whole world.</b>

08:16.991 --> 08:18.531
<b>If you don't want to humiliate yourselves…</b>

08:25.291 --> 08:27.921
<b>Aspire to be a fine hero like me!</b>

08:32.841 --> 08:33.801
<b>Master!</b>

08:36.431 --> 08:40.641
<b>As an A-class hero, I have some influence over the Association.</b>

08:40.641 --> 08:42.721
<b>I'll make sure those who behave irresponsibly…</b>

08:42.721 --> 08:45.101
<b>lose points and get demoted!</b>

08:45.101 --> 08:46.231
<b>Don't you forget it!</b>

08:47.811 --> 08:49.771
<b><i>What should I have for dinner?</i></b>

08:52.191 --> 08:56.241
<b>Apparently, the Hero Association 
was formed about three years ago.</b>

08:57.991 --> 09:00.031
<b>So it's only been around for three years?</b>

09:00.031 --> 09:04.001
<b>It was after the grandchild of a millionaire called Agoni was attacked by a monster.</b>

09:04.001 --> 09:06.961
<b>The child was saved by a passerby.</b>

09:06.961 --> 09:09.041
<b>When Agoni heard what had happened,</b>

09:09.041 --> 09:14.511
<b>he came up with this system and used his fortune 
to establish the Hero Association.</b>

09:14.511 --> 09:17.681
<b>Well, they put on some pretty boring seminars.</b>

09:17.681 --> 09:24.061
<b>In any case, as new{freshly certified} heroes, 
