<b>Office</b>

10:02.391 --> 10:02.431
<b>m 616.5 193.5 b 639 204 685.5 223.5 709.5 234 735 241.5 786 255 811.5 261 829.5 265.5 865.5 273 883.5 277.5 897 279 922.5 280.5 936 282 946.5 283.5 967.5 285 978 285 987 283.5 1005 279 1014 277.5 1021.5 276 1035 274.5 1041 273 1050 276 1066.5 282 1074 283.5 1090.5 292.5 1125 309 1141.5 318 1158 321 1189.5 328.5 1206 331.5 1221 331.5 1248 331.5 1263 331.5 1270.5 342 1285.5 363 1293 373.5 1288.5 387 1276.5 412.5 1272 426 1249.5 423 1207.5 414 1185 411 1162.5 402 1117.5 384 1095 375 1071 372 1024.5 369 1000.5 366 970.5 364.5 912 361.5 882 360 864 361.5 829.5 364.5 811.5 366 804 364.5 787.5 361.5 780 360 771 349.5 753 331.5 744 321 732 327 708 336 696 340.5 681 339 651 337.5 636 337.5 630 333 618 325.5 612 321 607.5 318 600 312 595.5 307.5 591 300 579 286.5 573 279 571.5 261 565.5 226.5 564 208.5</b>

10:02.431 --> 10:04.521
<b>Their attitudes were awful!</b>

10:04.521 --> 10:09.941
<b>I'm rank 38 in Class A, dammit, 
and they had no idea who I was.{They had no idea who I even was.}</b>

10:09.941 --> 10:12.571
<b>Plus they don't know the first thing 
about how the world works.</b>

10:12.571 --> 10:14.071
<b>Damn amateurs!</b>

10:14.361 --> 10:16.151
<b>They'll be dirt-napping in no time.</b>

10:16.151 --> 10:16.901
<b>No.</b>

10:18.281 --> 10:21.871
<b>Genos got perfect scores on both the written and physical exams.</b>

10:21.871 --> 10:25.741
<b>He's a phenomenal rookie who was granted S-class status right off the bat.</b>

10:25.741 --> 10:30.291
<b>The other one, Saitama, 
had terrible scores on the essay,</b>

10:30.291 --> 10:32.841
<b>but scored a perfect 50 on the physical portion.</b>

10:32.841 --> 10:35.271
<b>That's the only reason he passed{how he was able to pass} at all.</b>

10:36.011 --> 10:38.511
<b>And in practically every activity on the fitness exam,</b>

10:38.881 --> 10:43.511
<b>he broke the Hero Association's 
test records by inconceivable margins.</b>

10:46.311 --> 10:49.851
<b>It's as if there's a god residing in that body.</b>

10:52.231 --> 10:57.151
<b>Snek, you've already been outranked by Genos,</b>

10:57.151 --> 11:00.701
<b>and Saitama may catch up with you soon enough.</b>

11:03.621 --> 11:06.041
<b><i>That jackass?</i></b>

11:06.871 --> 11:11.671
<b><i>If I get to the top of Class C, 
then I'll get promoted to Class B.</i></b>

11:11.671 --> 11:16.591
<b><i>Class A is above that, 
and Class S is right at the top.</i></b>

11:17.881 --> 11:20.671
<b><i>I guess Genos is actually pretty amazing.</i></b>

11:24.011 --> 11:25.431
<b><i>I dunno.{on't know.}</i></b>

11:26.181 --> 11:29.021
<b><i>Maybe this isn't the kind of hero I wanted to be.</i></b>

11:32.561 --> 11:35.611
<b>The {newcomer}induction seminar isn't over yet!</b>

11:35.611 --> 11:38.901
<b>Hazing rookies is common in this line of business.</b>

11:39.281 --> 11:42.661
<b>A lot of us heroes hate to be outranked.</b>

11:43.111 --> 11:47.201
<b>So we take care of newbies early on… like this!</b>

12:23.151 --> 12:24.411
<b>Hero Registry?</b>

12:24.951 --> 12:26.071
<b>Yes.</b>

12:26.071 --> 12:29.991
<b>I am an S-class hero, and you are a C-class hero.</b>

12:29.991 --> 12:31.951
<b>We are both ranked last in our classes.</b>

12:32.451 --> 12:36.921
<b>Right now, we are still listed as Genos and Saitama,</b>

12:36.921 --> 12:40.131
<b>but as we perform more heroic acts, 
we will acquire hero names.</b>

12:40.801 --> 12:43.381
<b>Hero names? What are those?</b>

12:43.381 --> 12:49.011
<b>I believe they are like nicknames 
that capture a hero's characteristics.</b>

12:49.011 --> 12:51.471
<b>For example, I might be the "Blond Cyborg."</b>

12:51.771 --> 12:56.101
<b>Wait, if that's how it works, 
won't I be {like }the "Caped Baldy"?</b>

12:57.311 --> 12:59.061
<b>Aside from being ranked by ability,</b>

12:59.061 --> 13:01.821
<b>you can also be ranked by popularity.</b>

13:01.821 --> 13:03.741
<b>Some heroes have fan clubs.</b>

13:04.701 --> 13:07.031
<b>Well, no one cares about that.</b>

13:07.031 --> 13:07.361
<b>Wha—?!</b>

13:08.281 --> 13:12.621
<b>Thank you for agreeing to my unreasonable request today.</b>

13:13.001 --> 13:17.171
<b>Well, I did promise to make you my {*}apprentice{*disciple}.</b>

13:18.001 --> 13:19.671
<b>Is right here good?</b>

13:19.671 --> 13:20.381
<b>Yes.</b>

13:21.341 --> 13:23.091
<b>So we're just sparring, right?</b>

13:23.091 --> 13:24.631
<b>Not fighting for real?</b>

13:24.971 --> 13:26.381
<b>Yes, that's what I have in mind.</b>

13:27.131 --> 13:29.391
<b>But I want you to go all out,</b>

13:30.141 --> 13:32.181
<b>so I too will give it my all.</b>

13:38.731 --> 13:39.941
<b>Please grant my request.</b>

14:16.181 --> 14:17.351
<b>That was close…</b>

14:17.351 --> 14:19.651
<b>My clothes almost got burnt again.</b>

14:25.861 --> 14:27.151
<b><i>I need more speed{to go faster}!</i></b>

14:51.051 --> 14:51.591
<b><i>He's gone?</i></b>

14:52.341 --> 14:55.221
<b><i>Have I been chasing his afterimage this whole time?</i></b>

15:01.151 --> 15:01.731
<b><i>There{ he is}!</i></b>

15:08.901 --> 15:10.111
<b>Incinerate!</b>

15:12.611 --> 15:14.371
<b><i>I got him this time.</i></b>

15:14.371 --> 15:16.411
<b><i>Master will have to take me more seriously now…</i></b>

15:17.041 --> 15:17.831
<b><i>Behind—</i></b>

15:18.871 --> 15:20.041
<b>Okay, I win.</b>

15:25.291 --> 15:26.381
<b>Master…</b>

15:26.381 --> 15:26.711
<b>Yeah?{yah???? nice meme cthuko/tsunshun}{Hm?}</b>

15:27.501 --> 15:29.971
<b>Have you forgotten the rules of this match?</b>

15:30.921 --> 15:34.551
<b>Dodge any attack you are able to dodge.</b>

15:34.551 --> 15:36.101
<b>Take it seriously. No fooling around.</b>

15:36.971 --> 15:39.141
<b>Do not hold back.</b>

15:39.141 --> 15:39.641
<b>Also…</b>

15:41.021 --> 15:44.061
<b>Keep fighting until I am no longer able to fight{can no longer go on}.</b>

15:45.521 --> 15:47.691
<b><i>Even my master himself cannot explain</i></b>

15:48.191 --> 15:50.941
<b><i>the secret to his power.</i></b>

15:51.901 --> 15:54.201
<b><i>This fight may give me some insight into it.</i></b>

15:55.781 --> 15:57.331
<b>Show me no mercy.</b>

16:02.411 --> 16:04.121
<b>Those were the rules, Master—</b>

16:08.171 --> 16:09.091
<b>What the—?!</b>

16:09.131 --> 16:10.591
DEATH

16:22.771 --> 16:25.521
<b>I'm starving. Let's grab a bite.{Time for lunchfood.}{it's night by the time they eat. don't use "lunch"}</b>

16:25.521 --> 16:26.981
<b>How does udon sound?{Let's grab some udon noodles.}</b>

16:30.321 --> 16:31.491
<b>Okay…</b>

16:34.201 --> 16:38.161
<b><i>I am prepared to do anything in order to become stronger.</i></b>

16:38.911 --> 16:39.601
<b><i>But…{way too short to snap}</i></b>

16:40.871 --> 16:44.001
<b><i>I can't picture myself ever 
approaching Master's power.</i></b>

16:45.961 --> 16:47.501
<b><i>Not in a million years.</i></b>

16:52.511 --> 16:54.131
<b><i>He's on another{a different} level.</i></b>

16:56.261 --> 16:57.431
<b>What's the matter?</b>

16:57.431 --> 16:58.801
<b>You don't like udon?</b>

17:02.601 --> 17:05.141
<b>I see, so that's where he is.{that's his location}</b>

